### Authentication requests (TS04, US01 to US03). Test data only. (Solo datos de prueba.)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@email = qa.owner@example.com
@password = TestOnly-Pass1

### Register -> 201 session (a second run answers 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "businessName": "QA Test Store", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "businessType": "bodega" }

### Same email again -> 409 EMAIL_TAKEN (R1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "businessName": "QA Test Store", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "businessType": "bodega" }

### Missing data -> 400 INCOMPLETE
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Login -> 200 session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Wrong password -> 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (R3: never says which field failed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "wrong-password" }

### Forgot password -> 200, same answer for an unknown email (R4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### Reset with an invalid token -> 400 INVALID_RESET_TOKEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "not-a-real-token", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Invalid session token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED (it must NOT show demo data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/productos
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
